cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "mmWave Assembly Anomaly Detection Dataset"
abstract: >
  Dataset and code supporting the paper "Detecting sequence and timing errors
  in manual assembly with a low-cost mmWave radar". Contains raw mmWave radar
  point-cloud recordings (TI IWR6843ISK, no DCA1000EVM), time-of-flight
  distance measurements, synchronized and labelled merged data for six
  sessions covering normal assembly, sequence deviations and pace deviations,
  the initial CNN-GRU pipeline (model weights and notebooks) and, from
  version 2.0.0, the analysis code, fold files, out-of-fold predictions and
  dated analysis plans of the paper (analysis/).
